      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-09T05:30:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Why only one flip per round? Isn't it that each unengaged ship flips a card, with a maximum of each pile flipping once? So, with two or more unengaged ships, both piles will flip each round, no?</p>",
