    {
      "id": 105644,
      "name": "Spiff",
      "username": "Spiff",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-09T13:47:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Where does it say that? &nbsp;The most I've ever seen written about what happens when a Sector is overrun is this:</p><blockquote><p><span><span>While Overrun, if no Station cards are flipped during the Opposition Flip Cards Event, then the Sector is cleared, and the Sector Panel flips back to the contested side.</span></span></p></blockquote><p>Nothing about changing how many piles flip each turn.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:35:19.259Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
